  },
  {
    label: 'Path 6',
    title: 'QA and test leadership',
    body: 'Owning test strategy, quality gates, and release confidence for a product without owning the feature codebase. Manual and exploratory testing skills, test-case design, and defect triage matter more here than writing new automation scripts every day.',
