  <h2 id="gates">Pass The 3 Gates before you commit months to one skill group</h2>

  <p>
    The 4-Checkpoint Protocol helps you compare skill groups on paper.
  </p>

  <p>
    The 3 Gates make you test the skill group in the real world before you spend months or serious money
    building it.
  </p>

  <div class="gates-block">
    <p class="gates-block__title">
      Do not lock in a certification or course plan before passing The 3 Gates.
    </p>
